// CP_HUB_BADPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2482897504" "For Romulus!"
// CP_HUB_BADPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1964511225" "Death to Imperious!"
// CP_HUB_BADPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4257546906" "Death to all who oppose Romulus!"
// CP_HUB_BADPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2141087757" "Long live Romulus!"

// GOODPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P507456623" "For Imperious!"
// GOODPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1661689251" "Long live Imperious!"
// GOODPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2290879553" "Death to Romulus!"

// CIMERORA_ALLHOODS_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3240291505" "The attack will begin in less than an hour.  I have some men coming around the mountains in the sea.  At this late hour, no one will notice them until it is too late."
// CIMERORA_ALLHOODS_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1055361174" "Yes, if we can break their spirit by taking their women, this will be so much simpler for us."
// CIMERORA_ALLHOODS_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3848293780" "Imperious is an old fool.  He cannot stop us.  Already the power of Romulus has grown so great that no one dares to challenge him."
// CIMERORA_ALLHOODS_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3702977007" "This fort will fall away into the ocean soon enough.  Trade here is paltry and soon their spirits will fade."
// CIMERORA_ALLHOODS_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1229948155" "Shhh.  Do you want the Captain of the Guard to hear you?"
// CIMERORA_ALLHOODS_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2419721332" "Which house shall we attack next?  Romulus seeks valuables in great measure."
// CIMERORA_ALLHOODS_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3571869299" "Do not worry about the old woman.  She speaks in gibberish.  No one believes her these days, prophecy or not."
// CIMERORA_ALLHOODS_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4154766398" "Senator Aquila must be dealt with.  He rallies the townsfolk against us.  We need them broken and weak."
// CIMERORA_ALLHOODS_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P205251153" "I tell you, the women first and then the weapons.  We must crush them from within, as before."
// CIMERORA_ALLHOODS_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2845216476" "I know not where the strangers come from.  I do not understand their garb or from where they get their strength.  We must get this information back to Romulus."
// CIMERORA_ALLHOODS_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3418656650" "Silence.  Do you want them to hear us?  We are a small number in this village.  Imperious has guards all over."
// CIMERORA_ALLHOODS_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4090523303" "Once Romulus has finally crushed Imperious, we can use this fort as well.  I have some plans for it."
// CIMERORA_ALLHOODS_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2133183312" "We do what we must.  Do not shiver like an infant girl or I will send you to the tombs for all your tasks."

// CIMERORA_ALLHOODS_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P363051388" "You will die!"

// CIMERORA_SHOVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1220944571" "Not so grand and strong now, are we?"
// CIMERORA_SHOVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2695579335" "Putting the herbs in your drink was simple enough.  Do you not feel well?  Oh dear."
// CIMERORA_SHOVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P175717236" "Your teeth rattle like bones in a bag.  Are you cold?  It must be the herbs we slipped in your drink."
// CIMERORA_SHOVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3394514275" "I can think of no greater pleasure than torturing you.  Perhaps, if you were Imperious...  Perhaps that would be more fun."
// CIMERORA_SHOVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2324075584" "Your time in this fort draws near.  Each day, we cripple your resources and scare away merchant trade.  Why do resist?  Do you not realize that it is already over?"
// CIMERORA_SHOVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2242702559" "Your old king is a fool!  You are a greater fool to continue in this ludicrous loyalty!"
// CIMERORA_SHOVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P119545707" "Tell me!  Tell me where the urns are kept!"
// CIMERORA_SHOVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1465448817" "I will break you in two if you do not tell me all that I seek to learn!"

// CIMERORA_SHOVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4064562641" "You will die like a dog!"
// CIMERORA_SHOVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1249896744" "Death to all who follow Imperious!"

// CIMERORA_ALLHOODS_BADGUARD_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3627150616" "I see nothing.  We are clear, for now."
// CIMERORA_ALLHOODS_BADGUARD_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2757199496" "If any ships should pass this way, we will see them first."
// CIMERORA_ALLHOODS_BADGUARD_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P768115709" "There will be no trade for these dogs.  We will make sure of that."

// CIMERORA_ALLHOODS_GUARD_LOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4174667699" "You shall die!"

// CIMERORA_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTERA_BADROMAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1498651507" "It is a matter of time before the fort falls.  Romulus will soon rule that, too."
// CIMERORA_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTERA_BADROMAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3458469286" "They cannot hold out for much longer.  I am sure of that."
// CIMERORA_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTERA_BADROMAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P977766952" "We have crippled their trade, stolen their treasures, and kidnapped their women.  There is nothing left for them to cling to."
// CIMERORA_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTERA_BADROMAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P915442391" "I await the day when Romulus crushes Imperious in a final death blow.  All of his simpering loyal puppies will fall under my boot."

// CIMERORA_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTERA_BADROMAN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3631701481" "Who goes there!"
// CIMERORA_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTERA_BADROMAN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P504747351" "We have been breached!"
// CIMERORA_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTERA_BADROMAN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3513325926" "Crush them!"

// CIMERORA_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTERB_BADROMAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P706789401" "It is so."
// CIMERORA_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTERB_BADROMAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2780147503" "As you say."
// CIMERORA_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTERB_BADROMAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2066155096" "Of course."
// CIMERORA_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTERB_BADROMAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P913343243" "Indeed, you are right."

// CP_HUB_BATTLE_GOODBADROMANS_GOODALERT_TEXT :
"P1571210567" "You there!  If you fight for Imperious, you must come help!"
// CP_HUB_BATTLE_GOODBADROMANS_GOODALERT_TEXT :
"P327296055" "Death to the traitorous dog, Romulus, and all who follow him!"
// CP_HUB_BATTLE_GOODBADROMANS_GOODALERT_TEXT :
"P601285095" "You will not win!"

// CIMERORA_ALLHOODS_GUARD_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1324030978" "The coast is clear."
// CIMERORA_ALLHOODS_GUARD_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3832140818" "We will keep watch into the night.  I do not trust Romulus and fear he will send more men while the fort sleeps."
// CIMERORA_ALLHOODS_GUARD_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1665088920" "We must keep our eyes and ears open.  Romulus and his men have been entering this fort far too often lately."
// CIMERORA_ALLHOODS_GUARD_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1775731776" "I do not understand the reasons for the change in Romulus and his traitorous dogs, but we are the line between them and our fort.  We must protect it at all costs."

// CIMERORA_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTERA_GOODROMAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1265901202" "The old woman was rambling on about another one of her prophecies.  I would dismiss her as dim-witted were she not right most of the time."
// CIMERORA_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTERA_GOODROMAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P433444663" "It is true.  The remains of his family were stolen right from the tomb!  I did not imagine Romulus or his men could sink lower.  And then this."
// CIMERORA_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTERA_GOODROMAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4203467857" "Aye.  She was taken in the night a few days ago.  We rescued her, but she is much changed.  She fears everything now, even her own shadow."
// CIMERORA_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTERA_GOODROMAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1834862376" "Have you seen the strange garb these new travelers wear?  It mystifies me.  Marcus assures me of their nature, but some of them...I do not trust them.  Their hearts are not pure."

// CIMERORA_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTERA_GOODROMAN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P952330753" "You there!"
// CIMERORA_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTERA_GOODROMAN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3741500351" "Death to all traitors!"

// CIMERORA_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTERB_GOODROMAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2643468726" "Aye."
// CIMERORA_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTERB_GOODROMAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P79167753" "You speak true."
// CIMERORA_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTERB_GOODROMAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P45329299" "I feel the same way."
// CIMERORA_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTERB_GOODROMAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P120627883" "I believe it, too."

